sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Non-intrusive live session discovery and desk projection
  accDescr: LiveSessionWatcher scans ~/.copilot/session-state and ~/.claude/projects, parses the tail of each JSONL event log, classifies session activity into working, waiting, or idle, and assigns up to six active sessions to downstairs mini dinosaur workers.
  participant FS as Local macOS Filesystem
  participant Watcher as LiveSessionWatcher
  participant API as GET /api/live-sessions
  participant Scene as Three.js Office + Dinosaurs

  Watcher->>FS: Scan ~/.copilot/session-state/*<br/>and ~/.claude/projects/*
  FS-->>Watcher: File mtime + final 64 KB<br/>JSONL event tail
  Watcher->>Watcher: Classify status (working <=90s,<br/>waiting on ask_user, idle <=15m)
  Watcher->>Watcher: Sort by priority + updatedAt<br/>and assign deskIndex 0..5
  Scene->>API: Poll /api/live-sessions (10s)
  API-->>Scene: Return sessions[] + summary
  Scene->>Scene: Bind Mini Dinosaurs to Desks 0..5<br/>and update Command Deck pills
